OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F304A1785399492
OL,3,CAfghan data breach left people who had
OL,4,Cworked with UK troops in danger for
OL,5,Cyears
OL,7,FThe Afghan personal data breach was a
OL,8,F"foreseeable" failure in a system that
OL,9,Fleft people who had worked with UK
OL,10,Ftroops in danger for years, a
OL,11,Fparliamentary inquiry has found.
OL,13,FIn February 2022, the personal data of
OL,14,Fthousands of Afghans applying for
OL,15,Frelocation to the UK was leaked, six
OL,16,Fmonths after the fall of Kabul to the
OL,17,FTaliban.
OL,26,@pD@AOUpD@MO]
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G1/13
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
FL,305,300,200,140,000,100
PN,30402
SC,0002
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F304A1785399492
OL,3,CAfghan data breach left people who had
OL,4,Cworked with UK troops in danger for
OL,5,Cyears
OL,7,FIn a report published on Thursday, the
OL,8,FCommons Defence Committee said the
OL,9,FMinistry of Defence (MoD) lacked the
OL,10,Fexpertise to run the UK's Afghan
OL,11,Frelocation schemes and used secrecy as
OL,12,Fa "shield" against proper
OL,13,Faccountability.
OL,15,FThe breach was discovered in August
OL,16,F2023 when details of applicants were
OL,17,Fshared on Facebook, triggering the
OL,18,Fcreation of a secret relocation route
OL,19,Ffor those affected.
OL,26,@tD@COUtD@JO]
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G2/13
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
FL,305,300,200,140,000,100
PN,30403
SC,0003
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F304A1785399492
OL,3,CAfghan data breach left people who had
OL,4,Cworked with UK troops in danger for
OL,5,Cyears
OL,7,FIt was one of 19 "data security
OL,8,Fincidents" reported between February
OL,9,F2022 and November 2023, caused by a
OL,10,Fmember of MoD personnel sharing an
OL,11,FExcel spreadsheet with a "trusted
OL,12,Fthird party".
OL,14,FAn unprecedented superinjunction meant
OL,15,Fthe incident was not made public until
OL,16,FJuly last year, not long after
OL,17,Fapplications to the government's
OL,18,Frelocation schemes closed.
OL,20,FAn inquiry was launched last year with
OL,21,Ffindings published on Thursday.
OL,26,@oD@ROUpD@JO]sD@ZOUtD@LO]
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G3/13
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
FL,305,300,200,140,000,100
PN,30404
SC,0004
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F304A1785399492
OL,3,CAfghan data breach left people who had
OL,4,Cworked with UK troops in danger for
OL,5,Cyears
OL,7,FThe Defence Committee said the breach
OL,8,Fwas not "an individual mistake" but a
OL,9,F"foreseeable systemic failure" caused
OL,10,Fby "inappropriate tools, weak
OL,11,Foperating procedures, insufficient
OL,12,Ftraining, poor organisational
OL,13,Fcontinuity, and an inadequate culture
OL,14,Fof data protection and accountability".
OL,16,FWhile the spreadsheet was thought to
OL,17,Fcontain data for around 150 applicants
OL,18,Fto the Afghan Relocations and
OL,19,FAssistance Policy (Arap) scheme, it
OL,20,Fcontained hidden data relating to more
OL,21,Fthan 18,500 other applications.
OL,26,@pD@IOUpD@_O]qD@AOUqD@^O]rD@DOUvD@fO]
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G4/13
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
FL,305,300,200,140,000,100
PN,30405
SC,0005
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F304A1785399492
OL,3,CAfghan data breach left people who had
OL,4,Cworked with UK troops in danger for
OL,5,Cyears
OL,7,FThe committee described the MoD's
OL,8,Fapproach to using Excel as a
OL,9,F"continuing cultural failure" and
OL,10,Fcriticised its handling of the wider
OL,11,FAfghan relocation schemes as "utterly
OL,12,Fand obviously inadequate".
OL,14,FCommittee chairman Tan Dhesi said:
OL,15,F"The Ministry of Defence should stick
OL,16,Fto defence ` it should never have been
OL,17,Fleft to run immigration casework
OL,18,Fschemes."
OL,26,@qD@AOUqD@]O]sD@^OUtD@YO]wD@AOUzD@IO]
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G5/13
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
FL,305,300,200,140,000,100
PN,30406
SC,0006
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F304A1785399492
OL,3,CAfghan data breach left people who had
OL,4,Cworked with UK troops in danger for
OL,5,Cyears
OL,7,FMr Dhesi's committee also criticised
OL,8,Fthe secrecy that surrounded both the
OL,9,Fbreach itself and the role of UK
OL,10,Fspecial forces in the resettlement
OL,11,Fschemes.
OL,13,FAlthough it was initially expected to
OL,14,Flast for four months, allowing time
OL,15,Ffor the MoD to respond to the breach
OL,16,Fwithout increasing the risk of the
OL,17,Fdata falling into the hands of the
OL,18,FTaliban, the superinjunction remained
OL,19,Fin place for almost two years.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G6/13
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
FL,305,300,200,140,000,100
PN,30407
SC,0007
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F304A1785399492
OL,3,CAfghan data breach left people who had
OL,4,Cworked with UK troops in danger for
OL,5,Cyears
OL,7,FThe committee said that while the
OL,8,Finitial secrecy "may have been
OL,9,Fjustified", the length of time the
OL,10,Finjunction was in place "imposed
OL,11,Fserious costs on accountability and
OL,12,Ftrust".
OL,14,FThe MPs criticised the decision not to
OL,15,Fprovide a confidential briefing to
OL,16,Fparliamentarians, with then-defence
OL,17,Fsecretary Grant Shapps even resisting
OL,18,Fplans to inform his Labour
OL,19,Fcounterpart, John Healey.
OL,26,@pD@QOUqD@JO]rD@YOUtD@FO]
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G7/13
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
FL,305,300,200,140,000,100
PN,30408
SC,0008
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F304A1785399492
OL,3,CAfghan data breach left people who had
OL,4,Cworked with UK troops in danger for
OL,5,Cyears
OL,7,FReports have suggested that the
OL,8,Finitial breach was connected to UK
OL,9,Fspecial forces' involvement in
OL,10,Fdeciding applications for relocations
OL,11,Ffrom their Afghan counterparts, the so-
OL,12,Fcalled "Triples".
OL,14,FMPs also raised concerns about the
OL,15,Fhandling of the Triples, who had
OL,16,Fworked closely with UK forces but in
OL,17,Fhundreds of cases had their
OL,18,Fapplications for resettlement refused.
OL,26,@tD@HOUtD@PO]
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G8/13
