PN,30409
SC,0009
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F304A1785399492
OL,3,CAfghan data breach left people who had
OL,4,Cworked with UK troops in danger for
OL,5,Cyears
OL,7,FA review, described as a "major
OL,8,Fcorrective exercise" by the committee,
OL,9,Foverturned 884 of those refusals.
