PN,30410
SC,0010
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F304A1785399492
OL,3,CAfghan data breach left people who had
OL,4,Cworked with UK troops in danger for
OL,5,Cyears
OL,7,FThe committee said the government now
OL,8,Fhad "a special responsibility to
OL,9,Fformer Triples whose applications were
OL,10,Fwrongly refused and who, because of
OL,11,Fthose failings and subsequent delay,
OL,12,Fmay have spent additional years in
OL,13,Fhiding or been left to make their own
OL,14,Fway to a third country".
OL,16,FMr Dhesi said: "This inquiry began
OL,17,Fwith a data breach, but became about
OL,18,Fthe real lives affected by delay,
OL,19,Fsecrecy and flawed decision-making.
OL,26,@pD@EOUvD@WO]xD@POU
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                   G10/13
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
