OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
FL,305,300,200,140,000,100
PN,30411
SC,0011
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F304A1785399492
OL,3,CAfghan data breach left people who had
OL,4,Cworked with UK troops in danger for
OL,5,Cyears
OL,7,F"The Government must now explain how
OL,8,Fit will protect eligible Afghans who
OL,9,Fcannot safely, lawfully or affordably
OL,10,Freach a third country for UK entry-
OL,11,Fclearance checks.
OL,13,FAn MoD spokesperson said: "This
OL,14,Fincident should never have happened
OL,15,Fand we acknowledge the significant
OL,16,Fimpact it has had on many people.
OL,26,@oD@AOUuD@[OU
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                   G11/13
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
FL,305,300,200,140,000,100
PN,30412
SC,0012
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F304A1785399492
OL,3,CAfghan data breach left people who had
OL,4,Cworked with UK troops in danger for
OL,5,Cyears
OL,7,F"Thousands of eligible Afghans have
OL,8,Falready been safely relocated to the
OL,9,FUK, where they can rebuild their lives
OL,10,Fand we are committed to ensuring that
OL,11,Fwe conclude the Afghan resettlement
OL,12,Fprogramme by the end of this
OL,13,FParliament.
OL,15,F"We are learning the lessons from this
OL,16,Fincident and important reforms are
OL,17,Falready in place, including improved
OL,18,Fdata protection standards,
OL,19,Fstrengthened case-working processes
OL,20,Fand better programme governance.
OL,26,@oD@AOUwD@AOU
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                   G12/13
