CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F304A1785399492
OL,3,CAfghan data breach left people who had
OL,4,Cworked with UK troops in danger for
OL,5,Cyears
OL,7,F"We welcome the public and
OL,8,Fparliamentary scrutiny of our actions,
OL,9,Fso we can learn more and be held to
OL,10,Faccount, and we'll continue to work
OL,11,Fclosely with the committee on this
OL,12,Fissue."
